# Lede utils

> Lede 0.8.0's docs for Lede utils, installed with it. Every docs page and registry item: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/llms.txt. Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/lede-utils.md

`cn()`, LinkProvider (route Lede's anchors through your router), the tone types (`Tone`, `StatusTone` and `ToneSubset`) and the input helpers `focusLanding()` and `lastInputWasTouch()`.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/lede-utils
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [Overview → Install](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/overview.md) shows. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.8.0/lede-utils.json.

## Files and exports

| Installs to | Import from | Exports |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `components/lede/cn.ts` | `@/components/lede/cn` | `cn` (function) |
| `components/lede/link.tsx` | `@/components/lede/link` | `LinkProvider` (component), `useLinkComponent` (hook), `LinkProps` (type), `LinkComponent` (type) |
| `components/lede/tone.ts` | `@/components/lede/tone` | `Tone` (type), `ToneSubset` (type), `StatusTone` (type) |
| `components/lede/input-modality.ts` | `@/components/lede/input-modality` | `focusLanding` (function), `lastInputWasTouch` (function) |

